"rich_text","block_id":"kv2rH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"806856be-368b-46dd-b809-e02d2930b4ef","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"0.1msで削ってるので変わります（断言）","ts":"1625552724.283400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M1T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01ef6350-07af-4704-b676-98a93371975d","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"浪漫、とかならわかりますｗ","ts":"1625552723.283300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RZ/kx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0073859d-823c-45e9-9b01-edde5e522492","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"discover が少し重いかも？くらい？","ts":"1625552700.282400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fje"}]},{"client_msg_id":"419f0976-5856-4807-839d-31059cdd2220","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"素朴な疑問ですが `denops` 自体が Vim 上でやることってすごい少ないので、有無で起動時間変わります？","ts":"1625552675.282100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V84"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0473342-7aa2-439b-9e58-82bc6fa90ba8","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"手動登録という技が使えるけど他の人が作ったプラグインだとその技が使えない","ts":"1625552664.281900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sVum"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94221a1a-0d7b-4bcf-985d-b72c7e6f5540","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"更にいうと自分が作るプラグインは","ts":"1625552643.280900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GUQz="}]},{"client_msg_id":"5da65d92-8cbc-434e-80c8-e0974ea55074","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"この作戦だと、`denops#plugin#register({name}, {script})` が呼べるか？という確認が今度はいるのか。","ts":"1625552638.280600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"thj8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7472104-2aa7-4d96-9491-1a70ccb7bff6","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"つまり、denopsが初期化されてるかされてないかのチェックがいる","ts":"1625552633.280100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kjids"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2346f622-f6ab-4814-827d-6766da48ff72","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"なるほど。","ts":"1625552612.278800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3in"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77994ab5-4f3c-4e51-af87-18f688e36fef","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"denopsは遅延初期化されてるから任意のタイミングで呼ぼうとすると初期化されてなくてエラーになる","ts":"1625552603.278500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iW8QG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32780df0-b4f6-4968-95cd-454b71f979b6","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"これが難しくて","ts":"1625552578.277800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y+q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69993189-f306-4563-9fdf-a290b04d11a9","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"スクリプト名を main_lazy.ts にしておいて、必ず ddc.vim 側が登録するようにすれば。","ts":"1625552555.277300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PsS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"edddc20f-cddb-4368-9958-51772e420674","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"すでに `denops#plugin#register({name}, {script})` があるならプラグイン側で完全制御下におけそうな気はしますね。","ts":"1625552543.276900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WwUJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0553756-bfb7-4689-818a-ff341ec731e4","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"リロードされない前提で話をしていた。リロードされると話が変わる","ts":"1625552512.276100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Eshs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"121e31b9-cfcf-414e-9118-a656de72faf4","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"存在しなければ手動登録みたいなのをしたい","ts":"1625552460.275400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wzs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3a69bd7-41bb-429d-b22b-d06ab42a32c7","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"それが `denops#plugin#register({name}, {script})` ですね","ts":"1625552440.274900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qWPnD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36afcf5c-05c1-494d-a8fa-85e50ea6260d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"あー、りろーどされるのはまずいなぁ","ts":"1625552438.274800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SkdA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dbbdb614-fda1-4278-8536-647349da644d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"main_lazy.ts に名前変えておけば勝手に読まれないので、任意で registerPlugin するみたいな。","ts":"1625552415.274200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nti"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05680f4d-9a91-4c78-9d0e-4c6ddacd92b9","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"denops に registerPlugin みたいな ts のパスを指定してプラグインをキックする仕組みがほしいみたいな話なのかな。","ts":"1625552400.273800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o3l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92dbcbb6-ac98-4867-8907-360be32e1650","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"コレは回答になってます？","ts":"1625552271.273300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o6J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c52de79-7c73-48b8-8fbf-ad4840d67548","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"1. `denops#plugin#discover()` を呼ぶと「すべての」プラグインがリロードされます\n2. リロードを許容するなら `denops#plugin#register()` をロード時に手動で呼べば最悪一回リロードされますが動作は保証されます","ts":"1625552257.273100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nBV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"472d58c2-633e-4d80-bf1f-b1473d5d7941","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"あーわかってきた","ts":"1625552163.271800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aE2=3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d954de77-9ca9-4fa6-8eae-d3d1fdd210dd","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"遅延させる場合、denopsのロードタイミングにより自動でロードされるときとされないときがある","ts":"1625552076.271400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Utc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c55b7db8-d9d2-45f1-9f0e-cf43b91853c4","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01N4L5362D/p1625551941268700\u003e\n\nコレが困るってことな気がしてきました","ts":"1625552020.270500","attachments":[{"fallback":"[July 5th, 2021 11:12 PM] hrsh7th: ddc.vim 自体を遅延ロードする場合、denops が自動でロードしてくるのが困るみたいな話ですか？","id":1,"author_id":"U8R597E9H","author_name":"hrsh7th","author_subname":"hrsh7th","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U8R597E9H","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2020-02-25/956372982963_479264cbe2e1ea3d83ee_48.png","text":"ddc.vim 自体を遅延ロードする場合、denops が自動でロードしてくるのが困るみたいな話ですか？","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #tech-denops","ts":1625551941.268700,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01N4L5362D/p1625551941268700","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01N4L5362D/p1625551941268700"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V8Ut"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7a0c3c8-8e07-4307-be2e-80cb40fd4850","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"プラグイン側の対応はなさそうですね","ts":"1625551975.269400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6a1s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03fb57fc-932d-490a-b9cd-288dc4aeabb9","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"プラグイン側で対応するかプラグインマネージャーで対応するか悩ましいのです","ts":"1625551952.269200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bdkx3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"099653a5-67d1-410d-bb1e-56b6b4bd9ee2","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ddc.vim 自体を遅延ロードする場合、denops が自動でロードしてくるのが困るみたいな話ですか？","ts":"1625551941.268700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PtU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4609510f-0322-426c-8623-e8d34390aa2d","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ddc.vim 限定の話？","ts":"1625551932.268300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"znEO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4762f47f-41bc-457e-a1c0-41e2f0b15d8b","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"手動登録も確かにできる、万全を期すならdenopsに自動ロードさせるべきではないのか？","ts":"1625551931.268200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"joIT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"976e0f5f-14a8-4d55-83f2-09d24d6532be","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"んー dein.vim の denops 対応みたいな話です？","ts":"1625551921.267500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gb5RE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"737fe329-77f2-41ad-991f-13eea97f1732","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ddc.vimのプラグインではなくddc.vim本体の登録の話をしています","ts":"1625551870.266000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TwP7C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"afc387e2-d685-478d-aefc-d02ca67a8850","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"おっとｗ","ts":"1625551858.265600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ahN5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b92781c3-84b8-4a2d-b0fc-b060f7b73820","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"いや、そちらの話ではないんですけど","ts":"1625551852.265200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KDgb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a2adc56-6666-4eee-b7eb-60500dc15952","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"こんな感じで良いのでは？","ts":"1625551837.264800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nz9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b004a1e-415a-4081-93a8-bf79b6bf21b9","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ddc は\n\n1. 自分が読み込み終わったタイミング\n2. `User DdcPluginRegistered` が呼ばれたタイミング\nにて `g:ddc_plugins` を見て登録済みじゃないやつの `{プラグイン名}:ddcRegister()` 関数を呼びます","ts":"1625551827.264500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mn3Jb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec08fce1-bdfc-4b20-82f4-6f759c1760d3","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ddcA, ddcB は登録が終わったら\n\n```let g:ddc_plugins = get(g:ddc_plugins, [])\ncall (g:ddc_plugins, '自分の名前')\ndoautocmd User DdcPluginRegistered```\nを呼びます","ts":"1625551778.263500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eRxO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c28397ed-742c-4523-9cd3-fd365edd4a8b","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ddcA, ddcB は `ddcRegister(ddc)` みたいなエンドポイントを自分の API として公開します","ts":"1625551714.262000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rbh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"134f4e09-0337-4a0d-a039-615141aff41b","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ddc と ddcA と ddcB があったとします","ts":"1625551673.261100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c2m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05059a22-965a-4dc7-b7c6-ef9af1ebb4e4","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"まぁわざわざそういう事する必要もないかなとは思いますが","ts":"1625551652.260400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KTdS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4edae7f-43f0-4a32-9cf5-7fddfbb1d13c","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"`denops/XXXXX/main.ts` は *自動* で読まれるというだけで、別のファイル名をエントリーにしても良いので","ts":"1625551621.260100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8dth"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6235e75-c8fe-4c23-8177-0139ca4fc517","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"では `plugin.vim` で自分で自分を登録すればよいのでは？","ts":"1625551591.259600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qPy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87787487-a550-4c24-ae2c-0fb22f6ab04d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"はい","ts":"1625551570.259200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oNEBR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"312c2b6e-8d1f-4214-bb47-2f15892b6611","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ddc のプラグインは Vim プラグイン形式ですか？ `runtimepath` にはいる？","ts":"1625551556.259000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E7Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98519913-8676-4f65-9bcd-3bbe4ed73a74","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"まず前提条件がわかってません","ts":"1625551539.258600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ggU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83e47f4b-6947-4334-9b80-fc7f118a4966","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"まぁ、ロード時に毎回denops#plugin#discoverするべきと言う話もなくはない","ts":"1625551500.258000","edited":{"user":"U7JL1UKKL","ts":"1625551506.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d/vmk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77f67ee1-36d2-4e85-8897-5b9dcb483d8f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"その後でロードしたかったらdenopsプラグイン側が手動で登録する必要がありますよね","ts":"1625551465.257100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uq1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0ec09af-c132-4b5d-9af0-4e282c36c586","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"なぜならばdenopsの自動登録はVimEnterでしか効かない","ts":"1625551394.255700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/0B6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94a0d7b3-23f7-4d39-b2f7-97efb2d2b3c2","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"状況が全くつかめてないですｗ","ts":"1625551386.255400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x=4ox"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3eab108e-16b8-4b7e-bd3c-a80119fa03da","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ddc.vim自身のdenopsへの登録です","ts":"1625551361.254800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z+OJa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f7ed31b-ef92-4cab-9962-0aa8b4c2df82","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そちらではなく","ts":"1625551346.254300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YL/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b45fd0c1-07da-4a5f-a1d1-5bdfabcfe75f","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"たぶん `denops#callback` は話に入ってくる余地がないと思います。使う場所を間違えていそう","ts":"1625551288.254000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RYZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31d5badf-318d-43b6-8e59-625ed220e12e","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"でよくないです？","ts":"1625551247.253500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Oz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf7c1438-5b1e-4ff0-a7ce-de05a7e3366a","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"プラグインが登録されたら\n\n1. `call add(g:ddc_plugins, 'plugin name')`\n2. `doautocmd User DdcPluginRegistered`","ts":"1625551241.253300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P40R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41f590f6-7aa2-48d1-823f-fa869e080736","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"プラグインが登録されてるかチェックする方法がやはり必要です","ts":"1625551048.252100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cS4Do"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca7f47e1-cabf-417e-9947-817650ac56d6","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"あー、でも処理が遅延されるから結局うまくいかない","ts":"1625551010.251600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M5G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dadc28e7-e4b5-4288-8079-ac5811fae747","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"前言っていたプラグインが既に登録されてるかチェックできない問題の話です","ts":"1625550881.251100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oBg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63833237-fc83-45a8-b0af-d4f8cc478471","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"プラグイン側で変数作ればよいか","ts":"1625550849.250300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"buK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0b8b06d-5b75-4175-84bd-aa767833a5d8","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"いや、問題ないことが分かった","ts":"1625550838.249900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TKNu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a819762a-5ba6-4658-b337-548d364adf84","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"`denops#callback` の話は一体どこから？","ts":"1625550784.249400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Py"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29839ac9-563f-4a0f-81d8-8cecdc8d3a67","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"???","ts":"1625550763.249000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3qxy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6315524-0c08-495b-b7a7-90e83f1a3928","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"が、これの中身がプラグインから見れないという問題がある","ts":"1625550725.248800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Fzvz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35f17baf-efc4-4f33-b81b-9ae33f9ec68f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"確かに内部的に重複チェックしている","ts":"1625550704.248200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5XK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12919510-177d-4572-a722-f17041179d29","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"denops#callbackの実装をみた","ts":"1625550693.247700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9sP"}]}]
